A file that isn't valid UTF-8 gets DF1001 at 1:1, with the offset of the bad byte,
and no other diagnostic: the stream without PRIMARY KEY isn't checked.
-- dynaflux/page_views.sql --
-- visits to the café
CREATE STREAM page_views (user_id String);
-- want --
dynaflux/page_views.sql:1:1: error DF1001
-- want-text --
dynaflux/page_views.sql:1:1: error DF1001: file is not valid UTF-8 (byte 20)
  hint: save the file as UTF-8
